    "ultimate": "summon flying blades to attack enemies",
    "skill1": "knock down enemy and detonate marks on them",
    "skill2": "set up a field that enhances flying blades",
    "skill3": "battle ATK speed increase",
    "skill4": "receiving ally buff grants energy, penetration, and ATK SPD",
    "skill5": "deal bonus damage to enemies with high HP ratio"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Silven]] is a stationary ranged carry built around **flying blade summons** and marks that detonate when a knockdown lands. The ultimate launches blade volleys, while a field skill enhances their output for sustained AoE pressure. Temporary ally buffs grant [[Silven]] **Energy, Penetration, and ATK SPD**, rewarding supportive teammates. Bonus damage against high-HP-ratio targets makes the kit strong into bulky frontliners, while battle ATK SPD growth adds steady scaling. Immune or unmarked targets deny the detonation chain and leave the blade field underpowered.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Silven]] anchors behind a field, while blade volleys and knockdowns detonate marks and temporary ally buffs refund Energy, Penetration, and ATK SPD. Delete this stationary carry before the field and refund loop peak with [[filter:phys-backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]], then pressure the buffers. Prevent marked knockdowns with [[filter:steadfast]] like [[Igor]] or [[Gunnar]] and a separate [[filter:unaffected]] like [[Shakir]] or [[Sylphira]], so the detonation condition fails. If the fight runs long, race the blade loop with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]."
